2. GROMACS force field and data files  --  LGPL-2.1-or-later
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The example force field directories shipped with the lecture material contain
standard data and topology files taken from the GROMACS distribution,
https://www.gromacs.org, which is licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public
License version 2.1 or later. They are included unmodified so that the examples
can be run directly with GROMACS.

This applies to the following files in each of the min.ff directories under
ATOM_scripts_lecture/:

    atommass.dat, electroneg.dat, elements.dat, nsfactor.dat,
    residuetypes.dat, watermodels.dat

    flexwat-ferguson.itp, ions.itp, opc.itp, opc3.itp, spc.itp, spce.itp,
    tip3p.itp, tip3p-fb.itp, tip4p.itp, tip4p-fb.itp, tip4p2005.itp,
    tip4p2005f.itp, tip4p2005_nrexcl2.itp, tip4p2005_nrxcl1.itp,
    tip4pew.itp, tip4pice.itp, tip5p.itp, tips3p.itp

found under:

    ATOM_scripts_lecture/GMX_Water/gmx_Water/min.ff/
    ATOM_scripts_lecture/MINFF/GMINFF_3W_NaMMT/gmx_minff/min.ff/
    ATOM_scripts_lecture/MINFF/GMINFF_3W_NaMMT_basic_workflow/gmx_minff/min.ff/
    ATOM_scripts_lecture/MINFF/TMINFF_3W_NaMMT/gmx_minff/min.ff/
    ATOM_scripts_lecture/MINFF/TMINFF_3W_NaMMT_basic_workflow/gmx_minff/min.ff/

The MINFF force field files in the same directories, such as ffnonbonded.itp,
ffbonded.itp and the ffnonbonded_tminff_* and ffnonbonded_gminff variants, are
part of the MINFF force field, https://github.com/mholmboe/minff, and are not
GROMACS files.


