4. Bundled reference data
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The toolbox ships tabulated values taken from the scientific literature, such as
the revised Shannon ionic and crystal radii, bond valence parameters from the
IUCr, atomic scattering factors from Waasmaier & Kirfel (1995), and published
force field parameters for CLAYFF, INTERFACE, MINFF and others. The original
publications are cited next to the data in the corresponding files and should be
cited when the data is used.
